    "updated_at": "2015-08-24T09:52:29Z",
    "body": "What has changed since https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27865 to shift the balance towards keeping the fullscreen element stack, for you?\n\nIs there a practical problem with the current spec? Does it matter if there are a bunch of elements in the top layer where `:fullscreen` does not match? Normally the topmost element should obscure everything else anyway, right?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
