    "created_at": "2015-08-25T07:20:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-25T07:20:42Z",
    "body": "Do you mean, make `:fullscreen` match all elements in top layer with fullscreen flag? I'm concerned that could be a breaking change, as people may use `querySelector(\":fullscreen\")` to select the topmost one.\n",
