    "updated_at": "2015-08-26T07:32:44Z",
    "body": "OK, so to summarize, the only change would be to make `:fullscreen` match any element with the fullscreen flag set? That seems OK, even if it's a bit weird that we'll have a single `Document.fullscreenElement` and in some cases `document.querySelector(':fullscreen')` will not return that element.\n",
